-- Smash history, step H1(a) (docs/archive-plan.md): top 8s for 2014-2016 majors from start.gg (smash.gg),
-- which Smashy is allowed to read with its key. Each hand-added major was looked up on start.gg by name
-- within a few days of its date (read-only, one request every 2.5 s, 2026-11-18); matches whose name didn't
-- agree were checked by eye and wrong ones left out (CEO 2015, Smash 'N' Splash 2, Canada Cup 2016,
-- DreamHack Winter 2016, UGC Smash Open and others), and a bracket whose entrant count differs by more than
-- a quarter is skipped. Brackets that had only 1st and 2nd (from Liquipedia's lists) get start.gg's top 8,
-- keeping Liquipedia's names for 1st and 2nd; places start.gg shows as "Deleted user" are left out rather
-- than named. Top 8s already read by hand keep their names and only gain start.gg player ids where the
-- names match (so player pages can find them). Missing entrant counts are filled in. Safe to run twice.

update public.major_events e
set top8 = v.top8, entrants = coalesce(e.entrants, v.entrants::int), saved_at = now()
